    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/0359fe21c31acac46bed39e047a0ddeb.avif?t=1741713560\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you want to support and contribute to the development of Demise Sanctuary, don't hesitate to Wishlist AND Follow the game on Steam, thanks!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIGHT FOR YOUR LIFE. GET POWERFUL. REGAIN YOUR FREEDOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IF YOU DARE.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demise Sanctuary is a fast-paced twin-stick action roguelike game set in a dark Sci-Fi universe</strong>, with a gameplay inspired by Risk of Rain, Hyper Light Drifter and The Binding of Isaac. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESCAPE THE SANCTUARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a Mage-Warrior with psychic abilities. You wake up in a grim place without windows. Your last clear memory is the capture of your ship by what you identified as the fleet of <strong>The Collector</strong>. This mad and powerful being now detains you in his <strong>Sanctuary</strong>, a mythical megastructure with <strong>ever changing room layouts</strong> where he keeps his impressive collections of other-worldly creatures and Artefacts. <strong>The Collector</strong> will now enjoy watching you <strong>explore</strong>, <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>harness the powers of Artefacts</strong> and eventually <strong>die</strong> in your attempt to escape the <strong>Sanctuary</strong>. But in this cursed place, death is only temporary, as <strong>The Collector</strong> will endlessly bring you to life, stripping you of all your Artefacts in the process. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unless you have what it takes to be the first to ever <strong>escape this Demise Sanctuary</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A customizable Hub from which you can explore procedurally generated dungeons</strong> full of monsters, bosses, traps, curiosities and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visceral combats</strong> with perma-death based on melee and range attacks and psychic abilities allowing you to slow and even rewind time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of stackable Artefacts</strong> of different rarities to combine and create powerful synergies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique and Boss Artefacts</strong> granting powerful build-defining abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic construction system</strong> of structures altering game mechanics and dungeon generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gratifying progression </strong>based on milestones granting permanent currency to unlock new items, buildings, rooms and Hub customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep risk/reward mechanics</strong> that you will have to master to prevail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Threat level system</strong> that increases the number of monsters in the Sanctuary after each dungeon exploration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse cheptel of monsters</strong> forcing you to stay on your toes and make the most of your Artefact-enabled powers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An engaging universe drawn with beautiful modern pixel art</strong> with dynamic shadows and detailed special effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A thrilling original soundtrack</strong> blending electronic and acoustic instruments for captivating atmospheres </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/7713aa1f1c10df2d54ecc5c3844c5f11.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIGHT FOR YOUR LIFE. GET POWERFUL. REGAIN YOUR FREEDOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IF YOU DARE.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demise Sanctuary is a fast-paced twin-stick action roguelike game set in a dark Sci-Fi universe</strong>, with a gameplay inspired by Risk of Rain, Hyper Light Drifter and The Binding of Isaac. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/9186002b20aab17eb043ec8745ca6e1d.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESCAPE THE SANCTUARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a Mage-Warrior with psychic abilities. You wake up in a grim place without windows. Your last clear memory is the capture of your ship by what you identified as the fleet of <strong>The Collector</strong>. This mad and powerful being now detains you in his <strong>Sanctuary</strong>, a mythical megastructure with <strong>ever changing room layouts</strong> where he keeps his impressive collections of other-worldly creatures and Artefacts. <strong>The Collector</strong> will now enjoy watching you <strong>explore</strong>, <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>harness the powers of Artefacts</strong> and eventually <strong>die</strong> in your attempt to escape the <strong>Sanctuary</strong>. But in this cursed place, death is only temporary, as <strong>The Collector</strong> will endlessly bring you to life, stripping you of all your Artefacts in the process. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unless you have what it takes to be the first to ever <strong>escape this Demise Sanctuary</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/b38587fb6c2fcca2d929e1180bf50019.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/4018189f2040e5a02ef530f1c612003e.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A customizable Hub from which you can explore procedurally generated dungeons</strong> full of monsters, bosses, traps, curiosities and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visceral combats</strong> with perma-death based on melee and range attacks and psychic abilities allowing you to slow and even rewind time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of stackable Artefacts</strong> of different rarities to combine and create powerful synergies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique and Boss Artefacts</strong> granting powerful build-defining abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic construction system</strong> of structures altering game mechanics and dungeon generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gratifying progression </strong>based on milestones granting permanent currency to unlock new items, buildings, rooms and Hub customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep risk/reward mechanics</strong> that you will have to master to prevail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Threat level system</strong> that increases the number of monsters in the Sanctuary after each dungeon exploration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse cheptel of monsters</strong> forcing you to stay on your toes and make the most of your Artefact-enabled powers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An engaging universe drawn with beautiful modern pixel art</strong> with dynamic shadows and detailed special effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A thrilling original soundtrack</strong> blending electronic and acoustic instruments for captivating atmospheres </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.poster.avif?t=1741713560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.webm?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1945770/extras/d3dcd674c39fe8b72a90a144f41e2571.mp4?t=1741713560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
